  characterDescription: "Badger\r\nFound in the northern sector\r\nOutfit inspired
    by william stuckley\r\nBobby Badger is one of the older animals invited to the
    Avebury Costume Party. He enjoys quietly watching visitors explore the Avebury
    Site, and has recently started painting and sketching. He also likes looking
    into the history of the site with his friends Terrance and Steve\r"
